{
  "id": "1SA.18",
  "number": "18",
  "bookId": "1SA",
  "reference": "1 Samweli 18",
  "verseCount": 22,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "18",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1SA 18"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "18",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu nea ghoahiit Dawdi giibaloolda Sawli, ghwanoas geat guroorooda Yonatan sea guroorooda Dawdi, ak ghabwariiyda Yonatan gidabwariiyda gurooroadaanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gageanda Sawli eaweedida, ak ea mwanung' gabiikta gheanyaawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwasin Yonatan neajeeda sea Dawdi, aba gideaba ghabwariiyda niny gidabwariiyda gurooroadaanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gafagu hang'da mida badayda hang'weaka suurja, ak ghoadaw Dawdi, ea hang'weakaaschi bea ng'ucheeda, eara ng'utaanyi ea ghuweang'daanyi ea ghealoadaanyi bea mananda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gawa Dawdi ak ghwanyagaada aba heeda ajeakta Sawli niny; bwak ea ghwanung' Sawli ghoah siida haweewa fuga ng'ucheeda. Ak ghabwariiy buuneesean ng'asheanji ea aba madeeda fuga gadiyeeda bea Sawli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Sawli gwashissa ghaang' Dawdi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Damanda hina ghoah, nea gwaleabu Dawdi bayiiga fuga Filisti, gwarina gadeemga mujiinajeega sean bea Israeli, nea gwasarman nea ghang'was nea ghapka roonyeeda sugoocheanda was Sawli, nea gwandeawa gidoondoorajeega, nea gwasarman duumjeenga hooseaneega, nea gwandeawa haleanjeeda sisarmaniida. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwasarman gadeemga nea gooriipisiinyi damanda sarmana.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Dawdi ghaghi hudeaba Sawli",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwayeesha Sawli Dawdi, “Nukwa hudeanyu haw siguura Merabu; gaydagoonyi ghoah gatmoadaang'u; ak geaghus woosa daruus ak ging'uchi aba badayda NG'UTAMIIDA.” Aba gideaba gwayi Sawli, “Maygudu dang'uta geadi nung'waada ghabwar Dawdi fuga Filisti.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghwalamda Dawdi ak gwayeesha Sawli, “Neada aniini geawooschi ng'eaha, ak ea geabeang'a fuga ghaheanya aba jeeda fuga Israeli, jea deaw siida jea googweaji sugoocheandean?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea iihita damanda jea eatawa Dawdi Merabu was hudeaba Sawli, geataw Adrieli bea eemeeda Meholati ghoah gatmoadaanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu ghabwariiy Mikali was hudeaba Sawli Dawdi; ak geerukusa Sawli, ak goohoosan ng'asheanji niny. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gooteemshi Sawli ak gwayi, “Nung'waada daadaw huda niny, ak abeeda gayghoah ghaseeda aba headaanyi, ak abeeda gaygoobisa niny geatinga fuga Filisti.” Ng'ata gwayeesha Sawli Dawdi deaba iyeenya, Asi ghamneawa gayhuuwa orjeeda eagweajeewi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean goobalool Sawli fugaaschi bea gadiyeeda nea gwayeesha, “Oopaloola Dawdi nea gabageaw ak gooyeeshi, ‘Ng'ula, ang'iing'i ghaabwariinyi sugoocheanda, sea fugaaschi sean bea gadiyeeda, asi huwa orjeeda jea googweaji sugoocheanda.’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwarukusa fuga gadiyeeda Sawli ng'asheesu iidiga Dawdi. Ak gwayi Dawdi, “Ng'asheanji iyoong'ulayi ea ng'asheanda mwanang' gideaba gayghoah siida dea jea googweaji sugoocheanda, aba gideaba aniini neada geawooschi siida bwarbwar biissa ea meawala gheang'da?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda fuga gadiyeeda Sawli ak gwarukusa niny, “Ng'asheega rugu Dawdi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwayi Sawli, “Asi gajayeeshiina Dawdi, ‘Sugoocheanda magasa haleanjeeda gheenda geagasayi dimbaji bughala bea fuga Filisti ghoah waldeayda mureandooda aba heeda weajoodiga sugoocheanda.’” Nih gidagasiida Sawli gil gideaba gayghabwar Dawdi fuga Filisti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu nea gwarukusa fugaaschi bea gadiyeeda ng'asheesu Dawdi, goohoosan Dawdi muuchi gideaba gayghoah orjeeda jea googweaji sugoocheanda. Nea abeeda ea miighwahidu damanda geeshooda, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ghang'eat Dawdi ak gawa nea goodeayi sea fugaaschi, ak ghabwar fih bughalaji iyeenya bea Filisti; ak gweadu Dawdi dimbajeega nyaawa, ak geeyiitiisa sean sugoocheanda, ak abeeda ghoah orjeeda jea googweaji sugoocheanda. Ak ghoadaw Sawli niny hudaanyi siguura Mikali ghoah gatmoadaanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean nea gwajeeng'u Sawli gideaba NG'UTAMIIDA gwandeayi sea Dawdi, ea gideaba ghabwariiy buuneesean bea Israeli niny, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ghoawal Sawli muuchi Dawdi. Ak ghoah Sawli weajoocheanda Dawdi aba jeeda eaweagaaschi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghapka fuga hees bea Filisti ng'ucheeda, ak eara iissa ibuwa ng'ucheeda iissa gwajooriischi Dawdi muuchi ea ghang'al fuga sean bea gadiyeeda Sawli, ak gageawiit iitaanyi muuchi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
